      "writtenOn": "2025-12-03T19:22:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it should be possible to use [this constructor of `rust::Slice`](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/rust/chromium_crates_io/vendor/cxx-v1/include/cxx.h;l\u003d194-195;drc\u003db2d540b15cad394746b9277911ae1192f25158aa) which would avoid having to manually pass pointer+size which is frowned upon in some APIs - e.g. see `UNSAFE_BUFFER_USAGE` annotations in `//base/containers/span.h`)\n\n```suggestion\n            rust::Slice\u003cuint8_t\u003e row_span(tempBuffer);\n```",
